FlorisBoard itself bundles or derives from third-party works. Their notices are
kept in the upstream source files and in app/src/main/config/licenses/. They include:
  - ICU4C data/license (Unicode, Inc.), see app/src/main/config/licenses/icu4c.json
  - Parts of CrashUtility derived from CustomActivityOnCrash (Apache-2.0, Eduard Ereza Martinez)
  - Keyboard height heuristics in FlorisImeSizing.kt, described upstream as "inspired by
    OpenBoard" (ResourceUtils, which originates in AOSP LatinIME, Apache-2.0)
Runtime library licenses are collected at build time by the AboutLibraries plugin
and shown in the app's About > Open-source licenses screen.

