Every change is marked in the source with an "AIChat MODIFIED:" comment.
The full delta from upstream is:
  git diff <import commit> -- mobile/android

  app/build.gradle.kts
      applicationId -> online.dainn.aichat.keyboard, app label -> "AIChat Keyboard",
      new BuildConfig.BASE_APPLICATION_ID field, dependency on :core:network.
  app/src/main/kotlin/dev/patrickgold/florisboard/app/settings/advanced/RestoreScreen.kt
      Backup package check uses BuildConfig.BASE_APPLICATION_ID and accepts exactly the base ID
      or "<base>."-prefixed variants (Restore.isOwnPackageName).
  app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
      allowBackup=false, fullBackupContent=false, dataExtractionRules -> data_extraction_rules.xml.
      INTERNET permission, networkSecurityConfig (cleartext disabled), and the exported "Import Extension"
      VIEW/SEND intent-filters (extension zip + application/octet-stream) removed from FlorisAppActivity.
  app/src/main/kotlin/dev/patrickgold/florisboard/app/FlorisAppActivity.kt
      onNewIntent ignores external file VIEW/SEND intents (extension import is in-app only).
  app/src/main/kotlin/dev/patrickgold/florisboard/app/Routes.kt
      Registers the AIChat account / saved conversations / memories screens (aichatAccountGraph()).
  app/src/main/kotlin/dev/patrickgold/florisboard/app/settings/HomeScreen.kt
      "AIChat account" (Tài khoản AIChat) entry at the top of the settings list.
  app/src/main/res/xml/backup_rules.xml
      Removed (was mis-wired as dataExtractionRules; auto-backup is disabled).
  app/src/androidTest/kotlin/dev/patrickgold/florisboard/ExampleInstrumentedTest.kt
      Asserts BuildConfig.APPLICATION_ID instead of the upstream package name.
  settings.gradle.kts
      Sonatype snapshots repository commented out; include(":core:network"); includeBuild("vi-input").
  gradle/libs.versions.toml
      jetpref 20251119T222500Z-SNAPSHOT (no longer published) -> 0.3.0-rc01 (Maven Central).
      OkHttp 4.12.0, Retrofit 3.0.0 (+ kotlinx-serialization converter) and MockWebServer 4.12.0.
  .gitignore
      Added keystore, .kotlin/ and build output entries.
  settings.gradle.kts (also)
      includeBuild("vi-input") composite build for the Vietnamese engine.
  app/build.gradle.kts (also)
      Dependencies on com.aichat:vi-input and :core:network.
  app/src/main/kotlin/dev/patrickgold/florisboard/ime/editor/AbstractEditorInstance.kt
      The "replace N chars before the cursor" body of commitChar() moved unchanged into
      replaceCharsBeforeCursor(); new public replaceTextBeforeCursor() and isExpectedSelection()
      for the vi-input integration.
  app/src/main/kotlin/dev/patrickgold/florisboard/ime/editor/EditorInstance.kt
      One-line hooks into com.aichat.keyboard.vi.ViInputBridge (composer swap, commitChar, commitText,
      backspace, selection updates, candidates, editor actions, selection/undo/redo, reset).
  app/src/main/kotlin/dev/patrickgold/florisboard/lib/ext/ExtensionManager.kt
      Registers the vi-input marker composer (aichat-vi-input) as a Composer subclass.
  app/src/main/kotlin/dev/patrickgold/florisboard/app/AppPrefs.kt
      Default subtypes = Tiếng Việt (vi-input) + English; new aichatVietnamese preference group.
  app/src/main/kotlin/dev/patrickgold/florisboard/app/settings/keyboard/KeyboardScreen.kt
      Shows the "Tiếng Việt" settings group (Kiểu gõ, Kiểu đặt dấu, Tự khôi phục từ tiếng Anh).
  app/src/main/assets/ime/keyboard/org.florisboard.composers/extension.json
      The with-rules Telex composer (id telex) is replaced by the vi-input composer.
      Marked with an "aichatModified" key (JSON has no comments).
  app/src/main/assets/ime/keyboard/org.florisboard.localization/extension.json
      vi-VN subtype preset composer telex -> vi-input. Marked with an "aichatModified" key.

